---
description: >-
  Regression test for issue #5496 — a task uses a mistyped 3-digit year
  ("202-12-01" instead of "2024-12-01") alongside a correctly-dated
  task with the same label, verifying the parser handles the malformed
  year gracefully.
---
gantt
  title Schedule
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  tickInterval 1week
  axisFormat %m-%d

  section Vacation
  London : 2024-12-01, 7d
  London : 202-12-01, 7d
